waymo,2025-09,12203504,129008000,128308000,130108000,9152628,15254380,1,1,1,1,1,1,"US est.: CA CPUC driverless VMT scaled to US via cumulative milestone intervals (IGNOREME.md, Waymo VMT Methodology). Cumulative anchors (re-chained 2026-08-28, monthly shape within each anchor interval unchanged): the Waymo Safety Impact hub's All-Locations total plus an estimate of rider-only miles in metros the hub had not yet benchmarked, less ~0.15M pre-series miles: 71.47M end-Mar-2025 (hub 71.432M + 0.188M), 96.52M end-Jun-2025 (95.965M + 0.7M) and 129.01M end-Sep-2025 (127.158M + 2.0M) (data/README.md, Waymo anchors). The earlier published milestones (9.3M end-2023 to 56.7M Jan-2025) are exact centrals minus ~0.15M pre-series miles, not floors. The cumulative band at this anchor was reset 2026-09-26 to the anchor's own uncertainty, the hub total plus the low and high unbenchmarked-metro estimates (1.3M to 3.1M) less 0.15M, 128,308,000 to 130,108,000, as at Dec-2025 and Mar-2026 (it had sat 0.85M looser below and 0.45M above)."
waymo,2025-10,13628264,142636264,141209901,144062627,9539785,17716743,1,1,1,1,1,1,"US est.: CPUC-shaped Oct-Dec profile x1.103 (x1.0653 before the 2026-08-28 anchor move), bridging the 129.01M end-Sep-2025 anchor to the 174.26M end-Dec-2025 anchor (the Waymo Safety Impact hub's 170.712M plus 3.7M estimated in metros the hub had not yet benchmarked, less the ~0.15M pre-series miles; data/README.md, Waymo anchors); +/-30% monthly band. Cumulative-band knots re-set 2026-09-04: Dec-2025 = the hub total plus the low and high unbenchmarked-metro estimates (3.0M to 4.6M) less 0.15M, the anchor's own uncertainty, as at Sep-2025 and Mar-2026; Oct/Nov interpolated (-1.0%/+1.0% and -0.8%/+0.8%); Jan-2026 = the Dec band plus January's monthly band. Re-chained 2026-08-28 with the monthly shape within each anchor interval unchanged."
